    title: "Intention Setting and Manifestation Practice",
    duration: "15–20 min",
    hook: "The word 'intention' comes from the Latin intentio — a stretching toward, a directing of the mind. Before any action, there is intention. Before any creation, there is vision. The relationship between what you hold in consciousness and what appears in your life is one of the oldest and most debated questions in human history — from ancient prayer traditions to modern quantum physics interpretations to neuroscience research on mental rehearsal. Whatever your metaphysical position on how deep this connection goes, one thing is clear: the quality of your intentions shapes the quality of your attention, which shapes the quality of your actions, which shapes the quality of your life.",
